    featuredImagePrompt: "Conceptual visual representing the AI startup valuation bubble and regulatory oversight. A delicate, glowing, iridescent sphere (symbolizing the 'bubble' of AI valuations) is held precariously between a strong, metallic, structured hand (representing regulation) and a rapidly expanding, ethereal, digital network (symbolizing AI innovation). The background subtly features abstract, blurred elements of global cityscapes (India, US, UK skylines) and circuit board patterns, suggesting worldwide impact and technological foundation. The color palette is a mix of speculative blues/purples for AI and solid greys/golds for regulation, emphasizing tension and balance. The visual should convey both fragility and immense potential.",
