      neutralCase: "A neutral perspective acknowledges the elevated global debt but suggests a gradual, managed deleveraging or \'financial repression\' rather than an outright crisis. Gold and Bitcoin might see moderate gains as inflation hedges, but not explosive growth, as their roles as alternative stores of value become more established but not critically urgent.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a medium-to-high probability that global debt concerns will continue to drive interest in alternative assets. While a full-blown, immediate debt crisis is difficult to predict with certainty, the underlying conditions highlighted by Dalio support a long-term shift towards assets like gold and Bitcoin. A probability-weighted outlook suggests a gradual increase in their adoption as hedges, with intermittent volatility, rather than a sudden parabolic surge.",
