      keyRisks: ["Adverse or unclear U.S. SEC regulatory outcome.", "Major security breach or exploit in a cross-chain bridge.", "Persistent macroeconomic instability leading to risk-off sentiment.", "Increased regulatory pressure specifically targeting privacy coins globally."],
