      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There is a 60% probability of continued strong growth in the AI sector, driving further market gains, albeit with intermittent corrections. A 25% probability suggests a significant market correction or \'AI winter\' due to overvaluation or regulatory headwinds. A 15% probability indicates a stable, but slower, growth trajectory as the market digests recent gains and integrates new technologies more gradually. The most likely scenario involves a sustained, but volatile, upward trend for AI-related assets, with increasing integration between crypto and traditional finance.",
