      bearCase: "Stringent data privacy regulations, ethical controversies surrounding AI and surveillance, and potential market overvaluation could deter investors. Companies failing to demonstrate robust governance, transparent data practices, or a clear path to profitability may struggle to achieve successful IPOs or sustain post-listing performance.",
